WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.710
- It was recently announced, Nick,

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.940
that Ariana is now coming,

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.180
and she's gonna take
your seat next season,

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.091
so here is the reason why I ask.

00:00:05.091 --> 00:00:05.933
- What?
- Do you have--

00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:06.766
- Wait a minute!
- What?

00:00:06.766 --> 00:00:09.490
- Exactly, exactly.
- Wait a minute!

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:10.800
- It's just this season.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.030
So like, here is my question though,

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.650
do you have any advice for her?

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:16.410
- No, I mean, Ariana, as we all know,

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.155
is one of the best singers in the game,

00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:20.710
and she's gonna be an incredible coach.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:23.680
I think the only advice I would give

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.579
is just not to trust any one of you.

00:00:25.579 --> 00:00:26.587
(Kelly laughs)
- Why?

00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:27.795
- A single word you say.

00:00:27.795 --> 00:00:30.810
- We've been feeding her
lots of useful advice.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.530
- Yeah, I'm sure, very useful.
- Totally.

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:33.500
- Yes.
- Yeah.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.704
- But she's gonna kill
it, she'll be great.

00:00:34.704 --> 00:00:37.420
- Yeah, I thought, yeah,
you could at least warn her

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.600
about the one she's
probably gonna sit next to,

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.610
might be nice.
- All of you.

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:41.539
- She watches the show, though.

00:00:41.539 --> 00:00:42.372
- Yeah, thoughtful.
- She knows.

00:00:42.372 --> 00:00:44.660
- She does.
- She knows about Blake.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.300
- She does watch the show!
- What does that mean?

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.537
What about me?
- Everybody knows about Blake.

00:00:47.537 --> 00:00:49.300
Everybody knows.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.716
- Lies and deception.

00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:51.810
Okay--
- I just hope

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:53.270
I don't step on her.
- Are you? (laughs)

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.894
- Look at her, she looks so tiny on there.

00:00:54.894 --> 00:00:56.238
- She is so tiny.

00:00:56.238 --> 00:00:57.870
- [John] I think the friendship
between the two of you

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.450
will be substantial.
- Wow.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:01.260
- I really hope she's
sitting right next to you,

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.543
it'll just look amazing.

